 "cells": [
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "2dbc1484",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# Superstore â€” Shipping & Regional Analysis",
    "\n",
    "A reproducible Python companion to the **Superstore Sales** Power BI project. This analysis focuses on regional profitability, shipping-mode mix, delivery time, late Standard Class shipments, and discount-driven margin pressure.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Dataset:** Sample Superstore â€‹ **9994 order lines** â€“ **2014â€“2017**\n",
    "\n",
    "> The notebook is intentionally descriptive: it identifies patterns and business hypotheses without claiming causal effects from observational data."
  ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "61b42665",
   "metadata": {},
    "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import pandas as pd",
    "import numpy as np",
    "import matplotlib.pyplot as plt",
    "\n",
    "DATA_PATH = \"../data/Sample - Superstore.csv\"",
    "\n",
    "# The supplied Superstore CSV contains non-UTF-8 characters in some text fields.",
    "df = pd.read_csv(DATA_PATH, encoding=\"latin1\")",
    "df[\"Order Date\"] = pd.to_datetime(df[\"Order Date\"])",
    "df[\"Ship Date\"] = pd.to_datetime(df[\"Ship Date\"])",
    "df[\"Days to Ship\"] = (df[\"Ship Date\"] - df[\"Order Date\"]).t.days",
    "\n",
    "print(f\"Rows: {len(df):,}\")",
    "print(f\"Date range: {df[\"Order Date\"].min().date()} â†’ {df[\"Order Date\"].max().date()}\")",
    "print(f\"Regions: {', '.join(sorted(df[\"Region\"].unique())}\")",
    "df.head()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "4a7e39a2",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 1. Regional performance",
    "\n",
    "**Business question:** Which regions combine scale with healthy profitability?"
  ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "b22d046b",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "regional = (\n",
    "    df.groupby(\"Region\")\n",
    "      .agg(\n",
    "          Sales=(\"Sales\", \"sum\"),\n",
    "          Profit=(\"Profit\", \"sum\"),\n",
    "          Orders=(\"Order ID\", \"nunique\"),\n",
    "          Customers=(\"Customer ID\", \"nunique\")\n",
    "      )\n",
    "      .assign(Margin=lambda x: x[\"Profit\"] / x[\"Sales\"] * 100)\n",
    "      .sort_values(\"Sales\", ascending=False)\n",
    ")\n",
    "regional.round(2)"
  ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "bef6aac1",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "fig, ax = plt.subplots(figsize=(8, 4))",
    "regional.sort_values(\"Sales\")[\"Sales\"].plot(kind=\"barh\", ax=ax)",
    "ax.set_title(\"Sales by Region\")",
    "ax.set_xlabel(\"Sales ($)\")",
    "ax.set_ylabel(\"\")",
    "plt.tight_layout()",
    "plt.show()"
  ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "b7e9d9a9",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### Interpretation",
    "The project report identifies **Central** as the key profitability issue: about **$501K sales at 7.92%% margin**, compared with **14.94% in West**. Central is therefore a large market with a comparatively weak return, rather than a small region that can simply be deprioritized."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "0d72799b",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 2. Shipping-mode mix by region",
    "\n",
    "*(*Business question:**) Is Central structurally different in its shipping mix?"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "f4f7a7d0",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "ship_mix = (\n",
    "    df.groupby([\"Region\", \"Ship Mode\"])[\"Sales\"]\n",
    "      .sum()\n",
    "      .unstack(fill_value=0)\n",
    ")\n",
    "ship_mix.round(0)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "9d2e8c74",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "fig, ax = plt.subplots(figsize=(u0, 5))",
    "ship_mix.plot(kind=\"bar\", ax=ax)",
    "ax.set_title(\"Sales by Shipping Mode and Region\")",
    "ax.set_xlabel(\"Region\")",
    "ax.set_ylabel(\"Sales ($)\")",
    "ax.tick_params(axis=\"x\", rotation=0)",
    "ax.legend(title=\"Ship Mode\")",
    "plt.tight_layout()",
    "plt.show()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "8e43cafc",
   "metadata": {},
    "source": [
    "**Finding:** Standard Class is the dominant shipping mode across all regions, and the report describes the mode mix as broadly proportional. That weakens the argument that Central's margin gap is primarily caused by a fundamentally different shipping mix."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "6dd83236",
   "metadata": {},
    "source": [
    "## 3. Average delivery time",
    "\n",
    "**Business question:** Do regions have materially different delivery performance?"
